      bullCase: "Despite the current pullback, the long-term growth trajectory for AI technology remains robust. Fundamentally strong companies like Nvidia, with leading positions in critical hardware and software, are poised to benefit from sustained enterprise and consumer adoption of AI. Current corrections could represent healthy consolidation phases, offering attractive entry points for investors with a long-term horizon. Innovation continues at a rapid pace, promising new applications and revenue streams.",
