      neutralCase: "The market is currently in a state of price discovery, balancing strong underlying technological innovation in AI against significant macroeconomic headwinds. While a sharp correction is underway, it may not signal a prolonged bear market but rather a necessary recalibration of valuations. Future movements will largely depend on the clarity of inflation trends, the Federal Reserve\'s policy stance, and the ability of AI companies to continue delivering strong earnings amidst a tougher economic backdrop. Volatility is expected to persist in the near term.",
