      probabilityWeightedOutlook: "There is a moderate probability (50%) of a neutral-to-slightly-bearish outcome, where Binance navigates the crisis with its reputation bruised but intact, facing increased regulatory burdens. A 30% probability exists for a significant bearish turn if regulatory responses are punitive or if further security lapses occur. A 20% probability of a bullish long-term outcome if Binance uses this event to significantly enhance security and rebuild trust effectively, becoming a leader in secure digital asset management.",
