      potentialCatalysts: ["Further adoption of institutional crypto products by major banks.", "Successful launch and widespread use of stablecoin payment infrastructure by SBI Solana Global.", "Breakthroughs in real-world asset (RWA) tokenization leading to scalable financial products.", "Clear and favorable regulatory frameworks from major jurisdictions.", "A sustained recovery in global equity markets boosting risk appetite."],
