    investorTakeaways: ["Recognize the dual nature of the crypto market: short-term volatility driven by macro factors vs. long-term growth driven by institutional adoption.", "Consider Bitcoin\'s relative resilience during downturns compared to Ether and DeFi tokens, which tend to amplify market movements.", "Monitor institutional developments from players like UniCredit, SBI, and SMFG as indicators of increasing market legitimacy and future growth areas.", "Evaluate structured products like Bitcoin certificates for cautious, regulated exposure to digital assets.", "Understand that real-world asset tokenization and stablecoin infrastructure are key long-term growth vectors for the blockchain industry."],
