      bullCase: "The increasing institutional adoption of blockchain technology, exemplified by Hong Kong\'s tokenized debt platform, signals a long-term bullish trend for the underlying technology. As more financial hubs integrate DLT, it builds a robust foundation for digital assets, potentially leading to greater efficiency and new market opportunities. Bitcoin, as the leading cryptocurrency, could ultimately benefit from this broader acceptance of blockchain, even if its short-term price action is volatile.",
