      neutralCase: "The market presents a mixed bag of signals. While institutional validation of blockchain through tokenization is a long-term positive, Bitcoin\'s short-term performance is heavily influenced by investor sentiment and macroeconomic shifts. The record ETF outflows reflect tactical capital allocation rather than a fundamental rejection of Bitcoin. The asset continues to mature, but its path will be characterized by periods of both strong growth and significant corrections, making a neutral stance prudent until clearer trends emerge.",
