    risks: ["**Quantum Computing Threat:** Potential for current cryptographic standards to be broken, compromising blockchain security.", "**Blockchain Performance Degradation:** Quantum-resistant upgrades could significantly slow down network transaction speeds.", "**Low Investor Demand:** Niche crypto investment products may struggle to attract sufficient capital, leading to closures and investor losses.", "**Regulatory Uncertainty:** Evolving global regulatory stances on CBDCs, tokenization, and crypto products could impact market stability.", "**Security Vulnerabilities:** Users not upgrading to quantum-resistant keys could face long-term exposure to cyber threats.", "**Market Fragmentation:** Inconsistent adoption of new security standards could lead to blockchain network fragmentation."],
