    featuredImagePrompt: "A conceptual visual representing the convergence of artificial intelligence and venture capital, set against a backdrop of financial market volatility. Imagine two distinct gears, one representing \'Robo.ai\' (digital, robotic, blue/silver hues) and the other \'QC Capital\' (growth-oriented, green/gold hues, perhaps with subtle sprouting elements), interlocking smoothly. In the background, abstract, muted lines or subtle distortions symbolize market turbulence and crypto market downturns (hints of red or grey storm clouds, but not overtly dark). The overall composition should convey strategic growth and synergy amidst external challenges. Focus on clean lines, digital aesthetics, and a sense of forward momentum.",
