      neutralCase: "The crypto market is in a phase of dynamic equilibrium, balancing periods of institutional interest and disinterest with continuous technological development. While speculative flows in ETFs fluctuate, the foundational build-out in DeFi and RWA continues, creating a complex environment with both opportunities and persistent risks. The market is maturing, but still subject to significant volatility.",
