      probabilityWeightedOutlook: "A \'Cautiously Optimistic\' outlook (60% probability) is warranted. The industry\'s proactive problem-solving (quantum readiness) and responsive crisis management (Ledger) are positive. However, the tangible financial losses from hacks and the unpredictable nature of political influence (Larsen\'s PAC) introduce significant headwinds. The long-term growth trajectory is likely to continue, but with intermittent setbacks and increased regulatory scrutiny.",
