    featuredImagePrompt: "An editorial news layout featuring a split image. On one side, a stylized, futuristic depiction of a quantum computer\'s glowing circuits, subtly overlaying a Bitcoin logo, representing the quantum threat. On the other side, a close-up of a hand holding a Ledger hardware wallet, with digital lock icons and a subtle, almost imperceptible microchip implant visible under the screen, symbolizing the supply chain attack. In the background, a subtle, blurred image of a political rally or a legislative building, with a solar panel icon integrated, representing crypto\'s political influence. The overall tone is professional, informative, and slightly cautionary, suitable for a financial news publication. Use a color palette of deep blues, greens, and metallic grays.",
